hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"47","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein suraj grahan hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ke sath [grahan ki] namaz padhi: Aap khade hue aur qiyam lamba kiya, phir ruku kiya aur ruku lamba kiya, phir khade hue aur qiyam lamba kiya, jabke woh pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir ruku kiya aur ruku lamba kiya, jabke woh pehle ruku se kam tha, phir [sar] uthaya aur sajda kiya. Phir Aap ne dusri rak'at mein bhi aisa hi kiya. Phir Aap [namaz se] phire, jabke suraj roshan ho chuka tha. Phir Aap ne logon ko khutba diya: Aap ne Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: 'Beshak suraj aur chand Allah Azz wa Jall ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain; inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta. Jab tum yeh dekho to Allah se dua karo, takbeer kaho aur sadqa do.' Aur farmaya: 'Ai Ummat Muhammad, Allah ki qasam, Allah Azz wa Jall se badh kar koi ghairat wala nahin ke Us ka banda ya Us ki bandi zina kare. Ai Ummat Muhammad, agar tum jante jo main janta hun to tum thoda hanste aur bahut rote.'"
"48","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Suraj grahan hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi jabke log Aap ke sath the. Aap lambe qiyam ke sath khade hue, ravi kehte hain: Surah Baqarah ke qareeb, ravi kehte hain: Phir lambe ruku ke sath ruku kiya, phir [sar] uthaya, phir lambe qiyam ke sath khade hue, jabke woh pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku ke sath ruku kiya, jabke woh pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kiya. Phir Aap [namaz se] phire, jabke suraj roshan ho chuka tha. Phir farmaya: 'Beshak suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain; inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta. Jab tum yeh dekho to Allah ko yaad karo.' Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap Apne is khade hone ki jagah mein kisi cheez ki taraf hath badha rahe the, phir ham ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap peeche hate! Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main ne jannat dekhi, to main ne us mein se ek khosha lene ke liye hath badhaya; agar main use le leta to tum us mein se khate jab tak duniya baqi rehti. Aur main ne dozakh dekhi, ya mujhe dikhai gayi; main ne aaj jaise manzar kabhi nahin dekha. Aur main ne us ke rehne walon mein se aksar aurton ko dekha.' Logon ne kaha: Kis wajah se, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: 'Un ke kufr ki wajah se.' Kaha gaya: Kya woh Allah ka kufr karti hain?! Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh shauhar ki na-shukri karti hain, aur ehsan ki na-shukri karti hain; agar tum un mein se ek ke sath zamane bhar ehsan karo phir woh tum se kuch [nagawar] dekhe to kehti hai: Main ne tum se kabhi koi bhalai nahin dekhi.'"
"49","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke ek Yahudi aurat un se mangne aayi aur kaha: Allah tumhen qabr ke azab se panah de. To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kya logon ko un ki qabron mein azab diya jata hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is se Allah ki panah!' Phir ek subah Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek sawari par sawar hue; phir chasht ke waqt suraj grahan hua. To Aap nikle aur hujron ke darmiyan se guzre, phir khade ho kar namaz padhne lage; to log Aap ke peeche khade hue. Aap lambe qiyam ke sath khade hue, phir lambe ruku ke sath ruku kiya, phir [sar] utha kar lambe qiyam ke sath khade hue, jabke woh pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku ke sath ruku kiya, jabke woh pehle ruku se kam tha, phir [sar] utha kar sajda kiya. Phir [dusri rak'at mein] lambe qiyam ke sath khade hue, jabke woh pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku ke sath ruku kiya, jabke woh pehle ruku se kam tha, phir [sar] utha kar sajda kiya, aur [namaz se] phire. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne woh farmaya jo Allah ne chaha ke Aap farmayen, phir 'Aap ne unhen hukm diya ke qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah mangen.'"
"50","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bete Ibrahim ke inteqal ke din suraj grahan hua. To logon ne kaha: Ibrahim ki maut ki wajah se suraj grahan hua hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak suraj aur chand Allah Azz wa Jall ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain; inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta. Jab tum yeh dekho to Allah ke zikr aur namaz ki taraf daudo.'"
"51","[AI-translation] Amrah bint Abdur Rahman (Rahimahallah) se Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere paas ek Yahudi aurat aayi aur kaha: Allah tumhen qabr ke azab se panah de. To main ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, to Aap ne mujh se ek kalima farmaya, goya Aap ke paas is mein kuch nahin tha. Ravi kehte hain: Phir ek din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Apni ek sawari par nikle. To main aur chand aurten hujron ke darmiyan se niklin. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Apni sawari se jaldi aae, yahan tak ke Apni namaz ki jagah mein khade hue. Aap ne takbeer kahi aur lambe qiyam ke sath khade hue, phir lambe ruku ke sath ruku kiya, phir [sar] utha kar lambe qiyam ke sath khade hue, jabke woh pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir ruku kiya aur ruku lamba kiya, jabke woh pehle ruku se kam tha, phir [sar] utha kar lambe sajde ke sath sajda kiya, phir [sar] utha kar lambe sajde ke sath sajda kiya, jabke woh pehle sajde se kam tha. Phir dusri [rak'at] mein bhi aisa hi kiya. To Aap ki namaz chaar sajdon mein chaar ruku [do rak'aton mein chaar ruku aur chaar sajde] thi. Ravi kehte hain: Phir main ne Aap ko us ke ba'd qabr ke azab se panah mangte suna. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya ham apni qabron mein azab diye jayenge? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Han; tum apni qabron mein aazmae jaoge, Masih [Dajjal] ke fitne ki tarah, ya Dajjal ke fitne ki tarah.'"
"52","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Amrah ki hadees jaise chaar ruku ke bare mein [riwayat] hai."
"53","[AI-translation] Sa'labah bin Abbad Abdi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ko Samurah bin Jundub [Raziyallahu anhu] ne khutba diya, phir Apne khutbe mein ham ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek hadees sunai. Unhon ne kaha: Jabke main aur Ansar ka ek naujawan apne do nishanon ke darmiyan teer andazi kar rahe the, ke suraj buland hua, phir siyah ho gaya yahan tak ke goya tannumah [siyah booti] jaisa ho gaya. To ham mein se ek ne apne sathi se kaha: Hamare sath chal; Allah ki qasam, is suraj ka mamla Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye Aap ke sahaba mein koi [naya] waqia paida karega. To ham chale, phir ham masjid pahunche, jabke woh [bheed se] gunj rahi thi; to ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke nikalne se ja mile. To Aap ne ham ko namaz padhai: Aap khade hue jaise sab se lamba qiyam jo Aap ne kisi namaz mein kabhi kiya, ham Aap ki aawaz nahin sunte the, phir ruku kiya jaise sab se lamba ruku jo Aap ne kisi namaz mein kabhi kiya, ham Aap ki aawaz nahin sunte the, phir [sar] utha kar sajda kiya. Phir dusri rak'at mein bhi aisa hi kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke namaz se farigh hone ka suraj ke roshan hone se ittefaq hua. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khateeb ho kar khade hue, ya mimbar par khade hue; Aap ne Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: 'Amma ba'd; beshak log gumaan karte hain ke is suraj ka grahan, is chand ka grahan, aur in sitaron ka apne tulu ki jagahon se hatna, zameen walon mein se kisi bade ki maut ki wajah se hai, aur unhon ne jhoot kaha hai; aisa nahin hai. Lekin yeh Allah ki nishaniyon mein se nishaniyan hain, taake dekha jae ke un mein se kaun Us ki taraf tauba se ruju karta hai. Khabardar, beshak main ne Apne is maqam mein woh sab dekh liya hai jo tum qayamat ke din tak paoge. Aur qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke tees Dajjal kazzab niklen; sab Allah Azz wa Jall aur Us ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par jhoot bolenge. Un mein se aakhri Aawar Dajjal [kana Dajjal] hai, jis ki dayan aankh miti hui hai, goya Abu Yahya ki aankh jaisi, ek aadmi ki [aankh jaisi] jo us ke aur Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke hujre ke darmiyan [rehta] hai. To jo us ki tasdeeq karega aur us par iman laega, us ka guzishta nek amal use nafa nahin dega; aur jo use jhutlaega aur us ka kufr karega, us ka guzishta amal use nuqsan nahin dega.'"
"54","[AI-translation] Safwan bin Abdullah bin Safwan (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] ko dekha ke unhon ne Zamzam ki pusht par suraj grahan ke liye do rak'aten padhin; har rak'at mein do ruku. Aur main ne Abu Ja'far Tahawi ko kehte suna: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i ne farmaya: Ibn Abbas ne akele is liye namaz padhi; kyunke imam ne namaz nahin padhai, aur agar imam namaz padhata to woh us ki namaz ke sath padhte. Aur aisa hi woh hai jo Lais bin Sa'd ne Makkah mein dekha: Imam ne namaz chhor di, to jama'at se namaz nahin hui. Aur unhon ne zikr kiya ke unhon ne un mein se ba'z ko Asr ke ba'd khade ho kar dua karte dekha. Rahe woh jo Makkah walon mein se rae rakhte hain, to woh Asr ke ba'd namaz se parhez nahin karte un [namazon] mein jo un par lazim hain; woh tawaf ke liye aur har lazim namaz ke liye namaz padhte hain. Aur ho sakta hai unhon ne use sirf sultan ke dar se chhora jab us ne namaz nahin padhai; kyunke sultan us zamane mein un se khel karta tha. Rahe Ayyub bin Musa, to un ke Madani sahaba ka mazhab hai ke Asr ke ba'd, na Subah ke ba'd tawaf ke liye na ghair ke liye namaz padhi jae; magar un par yeh ata hai ke woh us waqt faut shuda namaz aur namaz janaza padhte hain. Aur main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris ne farmaya: Aur main rae rakhta hun, wallahu a'lam, sunnat se daleel lekar ke main har lazim namaz auqat mein se har waqt mein padhun; aur sunnat se daleel leta hun ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jin auqat mein namaz se mana farmaya hai woh us ke bare mein hai jo us par lazim nahin. Aur main chhoti bastiyon walon ke liye jin ka koi imam nahin, jungle walon aur musafiron ke liye rae rakhta hun ke woh grahan ke waqt namaz padhen, jama'at se aur alag alag; aur shehron walon ke liye bhi yahi rae rakhta hun jab imam na ho, yahan tak ke woh use dar se chhor den; aur suraj aur chand ke grahan mein namaz barabar hai, farq nahin, siwae is ke ke chand ke grahan ki namaz mein qiraat buland ki jati hai, aur suraj ke grahan mein aahista, raat aur din ki namaz ke buland aur aahista mein farq ki wajah se. Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Jab grahan ki namaz mein dakhil ho to takbeer kahe, phir iftitah kare, phir Ummul Quran padhe, phir us ke ba'd Surah Baqarah ke qareeb padhe, phir lamba ruku kare jo apne qiyam ke aadhe se zyada ho, phir [sar] uthae aur Ummul Kitab aur ek surat padhe jo do sau aayaton ke qareeb ho, phir ruku kare jo apne pehle ruku se halka ho, phir sajda kare, phir dusri rak'at mein bhi aisa hi kare; magar woh us mein dono qiyam pehli [rak'at] ke dono qiyam se halke rakhe. Phir tashahhud aur salam. Aur agar us mein bhoole to us mein bhoolna ghair namaz mein bhoolne jaisa hai; salam se pehle [sahw ke] sajde kare. Aur agar suraj ya chand ke roshan hone se pehle [namaz se] phir jae to mere nazdeek us par dusri namaz ke liye lautna lazim nahin; aur agar log alag alag laut kar namaz padhen to mujhe zyada pasand hai. Aur agar suraj grahan hua aur namaz se der ki yahan tak ke woh poora roshan ho gaya to us par namaz lazim nahin; kyunke woh ek waqt ki namaz hai, jab woh jata rahe to ghair mein nahin padhi jati; kyunke us ki asl farz nahin. Aur agar us ka aksar roshan ho gaya, aur us mein se kuch baqi raha to namaz padhe. Aur agar namaz mein dakhil hua phir woh apni jagah se roshan ho gaya ya us ke ba'd, to apni namaz poori kare; kyunke woh us mein us waqt dakhil hua jis mein use namaz padhne ka hukm diya gaya tha, aur use poori kare jaise poori karta agar roshan na hota. Aur agar grahan hua aur suraj ghurub ho gaya jabke woh grahan zada hai, aur us ne din mein namaz mein kotahi ki aur raat mein suraj ke grahan ki namaz nahin padhi; aur use din mein padhe jab tak grahan zada ho; chand us sab mein jo ham ne suraj ke bare mein namaz ka bayan kiya [barabar] hai. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke farman mein Malik ki hadees mein: 'Beshak suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain; inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta. Jab tum yeh dekho to Allah Azz wa Jall ko yaad karo' daleel hai ke chand ke grahan mein namaz suraj ke grahan jaisi hai; kyunke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dono ke grahan ke waqt Allah ke zikr ka ek hukm diya. Aur kabhi aadmi Allah ko yaad karta hai aur Us ki taraf kisi nek amal se daudta hai; to jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) suraj ke grahan ke waqt namaz ki taraf daude, to woh zikr jis ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne suraj aur chand ke grahan ke waqt hukm diya, woh zikr hai taake Allah Azz wa Jall ke liye namaz padhi jae. Aur yeh Allah Azz wa Jall ke farman ke ma'na se milta hai: ﴿قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَنْ تَزَكَّى وَذَكَرَ اسْمَ رَبِّهِ فَصَلَّى﴾ [Al-A'la: 14-15]. Is ke sath ke Sufyan ki hadees bayan karti hai ke Aap ne suraj aur chand ke grahan ke waqt namaz ka hukm diya, aur Aap ka hukm Aap ke fe'l (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jaisa hai. To Ibn Abi Yahya ki hadees bayan karti hai ke Aap ne chand ke grahan mein namaz padhi. Aur main apne fuqaha mein se hazir raha jo chand ke grahan ke waqt namaz padhte aur wali [hukmaran] ko us ka hukm dete, aur un ke sath namaz padhte. Aur main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Aur main lazim nahin samajhta ke grahan ke siwa nishaniyon mein se kisi par namaz jama ki jae; aur [dusri] nishaniyan hui hain, ham nahin jante ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un mein se kisi par namaz ka hukm diya ho, na Aap ke khulafa (Alaihimus-salam) mein se; aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke zamane mein zameen hili, to ham nahin jante ke unhon ne namaz padhi ho; unhon ne khateeb ho kar khade hue, sadqe par ubhara, aur tauba ka hukm diya. Aur main logon ke liye pasand karta hun ke un mein se har aadmi andhere, zalzale, sakht hawa, zameen dhansne, sitaron ke bikharne aur ghair in nishaniyon mein se har ek ke waqt akele namaz padhe. Aur Basra walon ne riwayat kiya hai ke Ibn Abbas ne un ko zalzale mein [jama'at se] namaz padhai; aur ham ne use sirf is liye chhora jo ham ne bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne grahan ke siwa jama'at se namaz ka hukm nahin diya, aur yeh ke mahfooz nahin ke Umar (Alaihis-salam) ne zalzale ke waqt namaz padhai ho."
